		<title>WordPress 的不思進取，與沒骨氣的我</title>
		<link>https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/2026/06/17/wordpress-enshittification/</link>
					<comments>https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/2026/06/17/wordpress-enshittification/#comments</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[恐龍化石 Dino Fossil]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 20:48:31 +0000</pubDate>
