					<description><![CDATA[3月時看到 Muuu 被無故暫停使用多年的 WP.com site 的遭遇，為之感到很氣憤，參考： https [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">3月時看到 Muuu 被無故暫停使用多年的 WP.com site 的遭遇，為之感到很氣憤，參考：</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://pbear6150.blog/2026/03/08/wordpress-com-suspension/">https://pbear6150.blog/2026/03/08/wordpress-com-suspension/</a></p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">查了一下，2018 年一模一樣的問題就存在了（<a href="https://kheresy.wordpress.com/2018/07/28/wordpress-%E8%A2%AB%E6%9A%AB%E5%81%9C%E7%9A%84%E7%B4%80%E9%8C%84%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%99%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E6%84%9F%E8%A6%BA%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E9%A0%97%E5%A4%A7%E5%95%8A/">WordPress 被暫停的紀錄：部落格還要繼續寫嗎？ – Heresy’s Space&nbsp;</a>）。&#8230;</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">&#8230;老實說，有解釋等於沒解釋，也不確定這樣的狀況會不會再發生。就算使用自動偵測，也應該該告知拿回資料的時限和原因，一切都好粗糙⋯。</p>
</blockquote>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">我當時也認真考慮遷出 WordPress 。氣憤歸氣憤，今天我研究 self-hosting WordPress 的方案，卻發現價錢相對高昂。</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://perfecttheorem.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image.png?w=380" alt="" class="wp-image-315" /></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">用 <a href="https://github.com/myles/awesome-static-generators">Static Website Generator</a> 呢？我嘗試了一下一個方案，卻想到一個問題：</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">撰寫的文章多了，有朝一日網站每次更新會很緩慢嗎？</p>
</blockquote>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">我說的不是1年，2年，而希望有個網誌能陪伴自己10年、20年、30年。</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img width="723" height="479" data-attachment-id="318" data-permalink="https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/2026/06/17/wordpress-enshittification/image-25/" data-orig-file="https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image.png" data-orig-size="723,479" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="image" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image.png?w=723" src="https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image.png?w=723" alt="" class="wp-image-318" srcset="https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image.png 723w, https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image.png?w=150 150w, https://cylikesreading.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/image.png?w=300 300w" sizes="(max-width: 723px) 100vw, 723px" /></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">結果，<strong>沒骨氣的我</strong>（自從15歲對社會公平的追求意識萌牙，一直都經常沒骨氣），還是把 WordPress.com 的 auto-renew 改選為 ON 。</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">我可以做到的只是減少課金： <a href="https://perfecttheorem.wordpress.com/">https://perfecttheorem.wordpress.com/</a> 將在2028年初停用了。</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">「人不可有傲氣但不可無傲骨」，究竟在這個世界，如何保留清白之軀？還是那只是妄想，一切都跟骯髒的政治息息相關？</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
